# Project Successfully Running

I have installed the dependencies and started the development server for your portfolio project.

## Changes Made
- Installed project dependencies using `npm install`.
- Started the Next.js development server using `npm run dev`.

## How to View
The project is now running locally. You can view it by clicking the link below:

[http://localhost:3001](http://localhost:3001)

> [!NOTE]
> The server automatically used port **3001** because port 3000 was already occupied.

## Verification
The server started successfully as indicated by the terminal output:
```text
